# .vercelignore — ALLOWLIST. Deny everything, then re-include runtime files.
#
# Why an allowlist: a static host serves whatever it
# is given. SocialOS shipped without one and Vercel served the whole repo —
# CLAUDE.md, docs/ and supabase/ source were publicly reachable (verified
# 200s). A new top-level runtime file must be added here AND to any mirror
# script, or the deployment silently drops it.
/*
!/index.html
!/manifest.json
!/sw.js
!/css
!/js
!/icons
